sentences.text:
Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal in MFA.No.877/2021 preferred by the claimant is allowed-in-part;
ii) The appeal in MFA.No.4752/2020 preferred by the Corporation is rejected;
iii) The judgment and award dated 07.02.2020 passed in MVC.No.1701/2019 by the Court of XVII Additional Judge, Court of Small Causes and Member, MACT,
Bengaluru, is modified;
iv) The claimant is entitled to a total compensation of Rs.6,63,964/- as against Rs.5,26,284/- awarded by the tribunal;
 v) The enhanced compensation amount shall be  paid with interest @ 6% p.a. by the respondent-Corporation within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this order.

