8 vi) The amount deposited by the Corporation before this Court shall be transmitted to the jurisdictional tribunal;
vii) The compensation amount shall be released in favour of the appellant-claimant in accordance with the terms of the tribunal, upon proper verification;
viii) The original records shall be transmitted to the jurisdictional tribunal forthwith;
ix) All other terms and conditions stipulated by the tribunal shall stand intact.
Sd/-
